            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The memory limit decides which models can load. The increased-memory entitlement raises it on supported iPhones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存上限决定了能加载哪些模型。在支持的 iPhone 上，“提高内存上限”权限会调高这个上限。"
          }
        }
      }
