      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the model reasons before it answers. Slower, often better.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，模型会先思考再回答。更慢，但通常更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a Swift function that checks whether a string is a palindrome.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写一个 Swift 函数，判断一个字符串是不是回文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write a four-line poem about a train at night.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写一首四行小诗，关于夜里的火车。"
